  "description": "Su Da-Won, a freshman who can see the ancestral spirits by everyone’s side. All she wanted was a normal college life. But then, the enigmatic president of the occult club, Sa Da-Ham, appeared before her. For some reason, she can’t see anything about him?! On top of that, even the spirit she worships warns her to stay away from him... \n\nIs it fate, or a trap?\n\nA spine-tingling yet heartwarming romantic tale of two young people!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
